defconfig fragment: IPv6 NAT and MASQUERADE for Docker (CONFIG_IP6_NF_NAT, CONFIG_IP6_NF_TARGET_MASQUERADE).
Their Kconfig dependencies (NF_CONNTRACK, NETFILTER_ADVANCED, NF_NAT) are already on in the base defconfig.
Measured 2026-10-31: changes none of the vmlinux exported-symbol CRCs, so vendor modules are not affected.
Applies in the kernel tree (git apply), pinned at e615f34c7dcb.

--- a/arch/arm64/configs/vanillaKernel-defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/vanillaKernel-defconfig
@@ -103,6 +103,10 @@
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_ADDRTYPE=y
 CONFIG_BRIDGE_NETFILTER=y

+# Docker: IPv6 NAT + masquerade (thin kernel patch set)
+CONFIG_IP6_NF_NAT=y
+CONFIG_IP6_NF_TARGET_MASQUERADE=y
+
 # NixOS support (xattr on tmpfs)
 CONFIG_TMPFS_XATTR=y

